{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"screen\": \"从前有人在身边的日子仿佛在梦里亮起来，看得见，却够不着\",\n      \"source\": \"约第160小节，还会浮现另一幅短暂的画面：远方忽然被照亮，已经远去的家园在梦里显现——虽然无法回到那里，却远远地看见了它。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"把梦里显现的“远去的家园”替换成“从前有人在身边的日子”，改变了原本画面的具体对象。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"screen\": \"那份温暖先留在心里，回不回去，他还没想好\",\n      \"source\": \"像看着自己珍惜的东西，不必立刻把它抓回来。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿只表达不必立刻把珍惜之物抓回来，屏幕稿另加了他尚未决定是否回去的心理判断。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"screen\": \"回去先不急\",\n      \"source\": \"他想，回不回去以后再说，先把眼下日子过稳些，也许比急着回去踏实。\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"严重\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿把是否回去留待以后决定，屏幕稿却容易让人理解为已经决定会回去，只是暂缓时间。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ae76051-e143-476c-8317-fb5dc56acac6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T192345144712Z", "elapsed_seconds": 543.657, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T19:32:48.815543+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1ed5386ce04d56e528a45584ed71e9b06ec12a100d6f41fb92d4b626a92e9292", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Doc